{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39586","headline":"汉上登舟忆闽 · 翁承赞","name":"汉上登舟忆闽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉臯亭畔起西风，半挂征帆立向东。\n久客自怜归路近，筭程不怕酒觞空。\n参差雁阵天初碧，零落渔家蓼欲红。\n一片归心随去櫂，愿言指日拜文翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁承赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39586.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39586","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}